{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-06-10 16:09:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE CLOSES ON INAUGURAL GREEN BOND OFFERING', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND. , JUNE 10, 2022\xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) ("NISOURCE") CLOSED TODAY ON ITS FIRST EVER GREEN BOND ISSUANCE, RAISING $350 MILLION THAT WILL BE USED TO FINANCE THE ACQUISITION OF ELIGIBLE RENEWABLE ENERGY PROJECTS LOCATED IN INDIANA.'}